  "n": 29,
  "declared_policies": [
    "P1 PLURALS: §1.4 forbids stemming/lemmatization, so a plural surface token is NOT matched against a singular inventory entry (e.g. 'values' does not match MEASURE-NOUN 'value'; 'levels' does not match 'level'). Applied uniformly.",
    "P2 OPERAND SLOT: for O-1, the grammatical subject of the predicate containing the comparator counts as filling the left operand slot; the nominal governed by the comparator fills the right slot. Applied uniformly.",
    "P3 PRONOUNS: personal/demonstrative pronouns are noun phrases and therefore nominals for O-1/O-2/O-3 unless struck by the literal D-O2 list (I, we, you, they, the team, the author, the reader, this document, the following, the above). 'it'/'that' are not on that list and are not struck.",
    "P4 VALUE POSITION: §2.3's iff-clause requires a resolvable magnitude in a value position; pronominal 'one' ('this one', 'the previous one') is not a resolvable magnitude and does not fire T-2."
  ],
